<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MIDCOM started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MIDCOM started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Thursday it had started MIDCOM Communications Inc with a rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the long-distance voice and data transmission services company closed Wednesday at 5-15/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
